'''Jack''' (Japanese: '''ジャック''' ''Jack'') is one of the characters of {{DetPikMov}}. He is [[Tim Goodman]]'s childhood friend from Leaventown and is portrayed by {{wp|Karan Soni}}.

==History==
At the beginning of the movie, Jack tried to assist [[Tim Goodman|Tim]] in {{pkmn2|caught|catching}} a {{pkmn2|wild}}, lonely {{p|Cubone}}, hoping it would help Tim open up more. However, the attempt went awry, and the Cubone broke free. When Tim left for [[Ryme City]] after hearing about his father [[Harry Goodman|Harry]]'s death, Jack remained in Leaventown.

